tmux new -s llm_dataset

Inside tmux, run:

source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
cd /home/prachit2/vlm-conformal/px4_ws
source install/setup.bash

mkdir -p /home/prachit2/vlm-conformal/px4_ws/src/llm_drone/generated/offline_ground_truth/batch_logs
mkdir -p /home/prachit2/vlm-conformal/px4_ws/src/llm_drone/dataset/offline_ground_truth_runs

ros2 run llm_drone offline_dataset_batch_runner --world-dir /home/prachit2/vlm-conformal/px4_ws/src/llm_drone/worlds --world-glob '*.sdf' --px4-dir /home/prachit2/PX4-Autopilot --launch-script /home/prachit2/PX4-Autopilot/Tools/simulation/gz/launch_obstacle_avoidance_x500.sh --skip-existing-csv --continue-on-error 2>&1 | tee /home/prachit2/vlm-conformal/px4_ws/src/llm_drone/generated/offline_ground_truth/batch_logs/overnight_batch.log

Detach from tmux with:

Ctrl+b d

Useful tmux commands later:

tmux attach -t llm_dataset
tmux ls
tmux kill-session -t llm_dataset

Check progress without attaching:

tail -f /home/prachit2/vlm-conformal/px4_ws/src/llm_drone/generated/offline_ground_truth/batch_logs/overnight_batch.log

Detached one-liner:

tmux new-session -d -s llm_dataset "bash -lc '
  source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
  cd /home/prachit2/vlm-conformal/px4_ws
  source install/setup.bash
  mkdir -p /home/prachit2/vlm-conformal/px4_ws/src/llm_drone/generated/offline_ground_truth/batch_logs
